{"2809660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Remake of the End of the Greatest RPG of All Time", "steam_appid": 2809660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/2d2616b9cf67e01ebb154a7013b4ebb4.avif?t=1784392183\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deduction Puzzle game set in the last hour of a lost non-existent 90s JRPG complete with original manual, director's commentary, and clips of an unreleased amateur documentary, all used to uncover the secret at the heart of it all: &quot;What is the Greatest RPG of All Time?&quot; <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the materials, deduce how the game functions, and uncover the deeper secrets that lie within. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 4-6 hour genre bending adventure will twist what you think is possible in games, blurring fact and fiction into a one of a kind meta experience. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Manual Pages, Videos, Director's Commentary Nodes, and More.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat fearsome foes with specific weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an original score that harkens back to the RPG glory days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and More!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one question... what is The Greatest RPG of All Time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/2d2616b9cf67e01ebb154a7013b4ebb4.avif?t=1784392183\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/da6bf4f3c53f2fdbdf53759710285048.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deduction Puzzle game set in the last hour of a lost non-existent 90s JRPG complete with original manual, director's commentary, and clips of an unreleased amateur documentary, all used to uncover the secret at the heart of it all: &quot;What is the Greatest RPG of All Time?&quot; <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/c69d7be6234c8689ba6a3e0810f1c7bf.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the materials, deduce how the game functions, and uncover the deeper secrets that lie within. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/afe73071c6c4bb727fd1647c5b1cc983.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 4-6 hour genre bending adventure will twist what you think is possible in games, blurring fact and fiction into a one of a kind meta experience. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Manual Pages, Videos, Director's Commentary Nodes, and More.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat fearsome foes with specific weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an original score that harkens back to the RPG glory days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and More!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.poster.avif?t=1784392183\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.webm?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/fb815ac763a21e7cb0a7632b504dd2c8.mp4?t=1784392183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one question... what is The Greatest RPG of All Time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "A deduction puzzle game set in the last hour of a lost 90s JRPG complete with original manual, director's commentary, and clips of an unreleased amateur documentary, all used to uncover the secret at the heart of it all: &quot;What is the Greatest RPG of All Time?&quot;", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“I am wildly compelled”<br>Rebekah Valentine of Kotaku<br><br>“Remarkably creative”<br>Tonda Ros, Creator of Blue Prince<br><br>“Eventually, I will remember the... title for this game”<br>Jill Grodt of The Indie Informer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/9f9170300701215b32c602a7b90e0cf3da9e5482/header.jpg?t=1784392183", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/4e6858b6714440c5a02dfb22997cb3a4357718cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784392183", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/4e6858b6714440c5a02dfb22997cb3a4357718cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784392183", "website": "https://www.whatistherpg.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi